    "en": "Good heavens!",
    "la": "Prō dī immortālēs!",
    "fill": "dī",
    "skills": [
      "street.exclaim"
    ],
    "tag": "“O immortal gods!”",
    "explain": "Literally “O immortal gods!”. Cicero uses it constantly. _dī_ is the plural of _deus_ (the usual plural is _dī_, not _deī_).",
    "distractors": [
      [
        "Prō deus immortālis!",
        "_deus immortālis_ is singular. The exclamation calls on several gods: _dī immortālēs_."
