        "_dīs immortālibus_ is dative or ablative. The exclamation uses the nominative: _dī immortālēs_."
      ],
      [
        "Prō deōs immortālēs!",
        "_deōs_ is accusative. The exclamation uses the nominative: _dī immortālēs_."
      ]
